		{"id":"exec-weekly-focus-20260629","type":"text","text":"PPJ_WEEKLY_TOP_FOCUS_20260727_20260801\r\n\r\nWEEKLY PORTFOLIO FOCUS\r\nReport: 2026-07-27 to 2026-08-01\r\nPlan: 2026-08-03 to 2026-08-08\r\n\r\nP1 Finance - Databricks access and Rule Engine Catalogue\r\nP2 GDI - WFX API architecture and prototype\r\nP3 Costing - Sew v1.2 accuracy and GTAS/IED contract\r\nP4 Sourcing - UAT acceptance, handover and closeout\r\n\r\nWatch: HR rollout; Technical data acceptance; QSee on hold","x":785,"y":"-1180","width":1420,"height":220,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"exec-title","type":"text","text":"PPJ EXECUTIVE BOARD - CURRENT CANONICAL LIFECYCLE VIEW\r\nUpdated: 2026-08-02\r\nSource: PPJ-WEEKLY-20260727-20260801\r\nFlow: Pending -> Analysis -> Design -> Development -> Stabilize/UAT -> Production/Support -> External/Blocked/Tasks -> Closed","x":785,"y":-1440,"width":1420,"height":180,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"exec-command-template-20260708","type":"text","text":"PPJ_COMMAND_TEMPLATE\n\nSUPER COMMAND CENTER SYNTAX\nCopy this into a NEW TEXT CARD and change marker to PPJ_PROJECT_COMMAND.\n\nPPJ_PROJECT_COMMAND\nproject: [[FIN.AI.FINANCE.MANAGEMENT.v1.1]]\nowner: Khoa\nba_coordination: Khoa, Uyen\ntechnical_members: IT / Data / AI\nstakeholders: Finance, Accounting, Management\npriority: P1\nnext_action: Collect current finance report template and WFX source report\ndecision_needed: Finance approve KPI and mapping logic\nblocker: Data permission / source mapping\nrisk: Finance data exposure\n\nThen run:\npowershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File \"scripts\\Sync-PPJExecutiveCommandCenter.ps1\" -Apply\n\nOptional watch mode:\npowershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File \"scripts\\Sync-PPJExecutiveCommandCenter.ps1\" -Apply -Watch","x":785,"y":-920,"width":1800,"height":470,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"exec-board-title-20260706","type":"text","text":"PPJ_EXECUTIVE_BOARD_READABLE_LAYOUT_20260706\n\nPPJ EXECUTIVE MANAGEMENT BOARD\nDrag project cards between phase lanes, then run the Canvas phase sync script to update project status.\nLayout fixed: large horizontal lifecycle lanes, weekly focus and all project cards inside lanes.","x":785,"y":-400,"width":1800,"height":150,"color":"4"},
